on "We compute the dot product between $u$ and each of the listed vectors:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\cdot v & ={u}_{1}\\cdot {v}_{1}+{u}_{2}\\cdot {v}_{2}+{u}_{3}\\cdot {v}_{3}+{u}_{4}\\cdot {v}_{4} \\\\  & =2\\cdot (-2)+(-1)\\cdot 1+3\\cdot 0+5\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =-4-1+0+5 \\\\  & =0.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\cdot w & ={u}_{1}\\cdot {w}_{1}+{u}_{2}\\cdot {w}_{2}+{u}_{3}\\cdot {w}_{3}+{u}_{4}\\cdot {w}_{4} \\\\  & =2\\cdot 1+(-1)\\cdot 4+3\\cdot (-1)+5\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =2-4-3+5 \\\\  & =0.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\cdot x & ={u}_{1}\\cdot {x}_{1}+{u}_{2}\\cdot {x}_{2}+{u}_{3}\\cdot {x}_{3}+{u}_{4}\\cdot {x}_{4} \\\\  & =2\\cdot 2+(-1)\\cdot 0+3\\cdot (-2)+5\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =4+0-6-5 \\\\  & =-7.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nConsequently, the correct option is $v$ and $w$ only." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-74089/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ce8958e6-c578-572f-8b34-5513b6f64a51"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-74089"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-74077/selection/0ebaf08027b4114197f45f0e21c6b2a594c4b80e081fff923c98396f7b258619" :answer/id #uuid "d82ab3c0-bb79-54c2-b20f-9969aa60aefc" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$w$  only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74077/selection/c4a83500b8fb569ccaa9e00d481cfbde8c17c74fe59b3b8d928775fe425a3e4a" :answer/id #uuid "e6098f24-2bf9-50ea-ace1-188a550e96f2" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$x$  only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74077/selection/16a5a33b0e357a52c5716becdf9c8964d76e96a483b4c9d28b4cf63c054b6342" :answer/id #uuid "65a6754d-371a-5dbf-ac79-5caddc9133ee" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$x$ and $w$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74077/selection/bfbf91f109f6c4c7b8242ca2b1bf4bae476945344d0e5e07bf789ea29825342a" :answer/id #uuid "5d89e50b-5d96-5d5c-8dc0-3ba2eca31669" :answer/type :answ